>> list := Daim-teev tshiab.
list ~ ['hello'].
Tawm sau-ntawv: list tus-lej-suav.
list ntxiv-tom-kawg: ['world'].
Tawm sau-ntawv: list tus-lej-suav.
Tawm sau-ntawv: list rho-kawg, sau-ntawv: list tus-lej-suav.
list ntxiv-tom-kawg: ['there'].
Tawm sau-ntawv: list tus-lej-suav.
Tawm sau-ntawv: (list qhov-chaw: 0), sau-ntawv: (list qhov-chaw: 1).
list muab: ['xmas'] rau: 1.
list muab: ['merry'] rau: 0.
Tawm sau-ntawv: list tus-lej-suav.
Tawm sau-ntawv: (list qhov-chaw: 0), sau-ntawv: (list qhov-chaw: 1).
